From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:05:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Merge gl-renderer into coroutine-kernel line

Brings in:
* Abstract gpu::Renderer interface and GE frame recorder
* GLES2 renderer, shaders and ge_replay
* GL renderer: honour the GE pixel mask (depth-only clears), stencil/mask IR fields, settings parser, replay timing split and analysis switches
* Replay: merge-break statistics; scripted analog input for the bring-up pad script
* GL renderer: cheaper frames, write-back off by default, upload self test, vitaGL readiness note
* ge_replay: GE block transfers as the host does them, movie counters, texture detail
* GL renderer note: live against replay, movie status, render targets in dumps

